// A fast racer (2.6x the limit, 0.95 g corners) out-corners capped pursuers at dusk, breaks line
// of sight behind buildings and escapes after escape_time(level, Dusk). Violations are off so the
// chase stays below the helicopter's wanted level (with a helicopter overhead, escapes are rare by
// design).
//
// Seed 603 since the road network centreline fix (centrelines follow the road centre, not the
// first lane). Escapes are rarer on the corrected graph: seeds 600-607 averaged 1.5 escapes per
// 3 runs before and 0.6 after (603-607 escape once, 600-602 not at all).
(
    name: "police_escape_break_contact",
    seed: 603,
    time_of_day_h: 19.0,
    duration_s: 300.0,
    runs: 3,
    stop_after_first_pursuit: true,
    racers: [(district: Core, speed_factor: 2.6, cornering_g: 0.95, initial_heat: 15.0, violations: false, stay_in_district: false)],
    expect: [
        (metric: "escapes", min: 1.0, max: 3.0),
    ],
)
